    "technical_report": "技术报告",
    "The 1–10 Alien Evidence scale describes potential consequence if a central claim is true in the stated regime. It does not measure truth, source prestige, or certainty. A 10/10 is reserved for genuinely field- or civilization-resetting consequences rather than ordinary state-of-the-art progress.": "1–10 的 Alien Evidence 量表描述的是：若某项核心论断在所述条件下为真，可能带来的后果。它不衡量真实性、来源声望或确定性。10/10 仅保留给真正重置一个领域乃至文明的后果，而非常规的最新技术进展。",
    "The browser runs this entirely against the embedded public state. The deployed publication exposes the same objects as raw static JSON.": "浏览器完全基于嵌入的公开状态运行。部署的出版物以原始静态 JSON 暴露相同对象。",
    "The editorial consequence.": "编辑判断与影响。",
    "The FCMO Group name remains the public-facing umbrella brand and does not, by itself, determine legal authorship or ownership of FCMO AI material.": "FCMO Group 这一名称仍是对外的总品牌，其本身并不决定 FCMO AI 材料的法律作者身份或所有权。",
    "the FCMO Group, FCMO AI, and FCMO AI Newsletter names, logos, visual identity, or other branding as trademarks or source identifiers; or": "将 FCMO Group、FCMO AI 与 FCMO AI Newsletter 的名称、标识、视觉识别或其他品牌元素用作商标或来源标识；或",
    "The front page is only the editorial layer. Every signal resolves into a full research record.": "头版只是编辑层。每个信号都可展开为完整研究记录。",
    "the frontier.": "前沿。",
    "The functional titles above must not be presented as formally appointed corporate offices while FCMO is not a separate legal entity.": "在 FCMO 尚未成为独立法律实体期间，上述职能头衔不得被表述为正式任命的公司职务。",
    "The hosting and network providers used to deliver the site may process routine request metadata under their own terms and privacy policies.": "用于交付本站点的托管与网络服务商，可能依据其自身条款与隐私政策处理常规请求元数据。",
    "THE LIBRARY REMAINS EXHAUSTIVE. VISUAL PROMINENCE NEVER REPLACES EVIDENCE CLASS.": "资料库保持完整。视觉突出度绝不取代证据等级。",
    "The library remains exhaustive. Visual prominence never replaces evidence class.": "资料库保持完整。视觉突出度绝不取代证据等级。",
    "The public publication is designed to contain only material intended for public distribution. Operational credentials, private workspaces, private project context and non-public publishing metadata are outside the publication contract.": "公开发布内容的设计原则是仅包含拟对外公开的材料。运行凭据、私有工作区、私有项目上下文以及非公开的发布元数据，均不在发布契约范围内。",
    "The public site must not claim that FCMO Group owns material merely because it is published under the FCMO brand.": "公开站点不得仅因材料以 FCMO 品牌发布，就声称 FCMO Group 拥有该材料。",
    "The site may load selected story-specific images directly from cited paper, project, laboratory or publisher hosts. Those requests use no-referrer where supported, but the remote host may still receive routine request metadata under its own terms. Following an external source link likewise takes you to a third-party service whose policies apply there.": "本站点可能直接从被引用的论文、项目、实验室或出版方服务器加载特定报道的图片。在受支持的情况下，这些请求使用 no-referrer，但远端服务器仍可能依据其自身条款接收常规请求元数据。点击外部来源链接同样会将你带往第三方服务，届时适用该方的政策。",
    "The site must not imply that Javier Castellanos Peña is an author of FCMO AI material solely because he founded the broader FCMO Group.": "本站点不得仅因 Javier Castellanos Peña 创立了更广义的 FCMO Group，就暗示其为 FCMO AI 材料的作者。",
    "The timeline below tracks the event or research date of the underlying work.": "下方时间线记录底层工作的事件日期或研究日期。",
    "These machine-readable surfaces contain the same publication-safe research information used by the site. They are provided for reading, search, archiving and analysis.": "这些机器可读接口包含与站点相同的、可安全公开的研究信息。它们供阅读、检索、存档与分析之用。",
    "third-party articles, papers, quotations, images, figures, videos, datasets, logos, trademarks, or other referenced material;": "第三方的文章、论文、引文、图片、图表、视频、数据集、标识、商标或其他被引用的材料；",
    "Third-party material remains subject to its original rights, terms, and licenses.": "第三方材料仍受其原始权利、条款与许可的约束。",
    "third-party material: governed by its original rights and licenses;": "第三方材料：受其原始权利与许可约束；",
    "This date is preserved as research chronology only. It was not issued as a newsletter.": "该日期仅作为研究年表保留，并未作为通讯发布。",
    "This dossier is an FCMO synthesis of third-party sources, not a reproduction of their original text. Source links lead to the original publications; FCMO selected, organized, and summarized the material.": "本档案是 FCMO 对第三方来源的综合摘要，并非对其原文的复制。来源链接通向原始发布内容；FCMO 对材料进行了筛选、组织和概述。",
    "This is a map of the editorial object, not a score.": "这是编辑对象的地图，而不是评分。",
